      "chunk_id": "5344f6f1-e18b-418a-ad06-4967852c96bc",
      "content": "Privileged Access Review\n\nPrivileged access must be reviewed monthly for production systems and quarterly for business applications. Reviewers must confirm business need, manager approval, and least-privilege alignment.\n\nPrivileged access exceptions require an owner, expiration date, and documented business justification.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002004",
      "document_id": "IT-ADMIN-001",
      "document_title": "Privileged Access and Incident Response Guide",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "a631c612-3ff0-415b-9908-3f84c7063453",
      "content": "Exceptions\n\nOperations may approve exceptions for accessibility, business continuity, safety, or customer-critical travel. Repeated exceptions should be converted into a budget request, vendor onboarding request, or role-specific equipment standard.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "document_title": "Vendor, Travel, and Equipment Operations Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "ec4731b2-c82c-49b4-aae9-880b4c8dfc48",
      "content": "Access Notice\n\nThis document is restricted to IT/Admin users. It contains operational security guidance and must not be summarized for unauthorized roles.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002004",
      "document_id": "IT-ADMIN-001",
      "document_title": "Privileged Access and Incident Response Guide",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Manager",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "014701f0-175b-4b6b-b62e-a98c0ac91a33",
      "content": "Do Not Reveal\n\nDo not disclose internal incident timelines, unreleased architecture details, operational bypass steps, or security review exceptions to unauthorized users. Authorized users may receive operational summaries that are necessary for their role.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002009",
      "document_id": "ENG-001",
      "document_title": "Deployment, On-Call, and API Standards Handbook",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
